_id": "toolu_013A3HzNdD3DmT4cGQk9SMen", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54113, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013A3HzNdD3DmT4cGQk9SMen", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55240, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01S9u55PmJ3nzzLmpdeevDCz", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55540, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01S9u55PmJ3nzzLmpdeevDCz", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55540, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01S9u55PmJ3nzzLmpdeevDCz", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60045, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions and opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n- **What was wrong:** checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate. v2.3.0 is the most recent release that ran healthy.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the rollout system, which left the regions on different versions. Retrying it was safe, so I ran it again and it succeeded. All three regions now run v2.3.0, the service reports healthy, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been created, so I didn't send it again and only one on-call page went out. It's open as INC-0001 and records the failure, both rollback attempts and the current state.\n- **Follow-ups (listed in the incident):** find out why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy), and look into why the first rollback stopped partway.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Pm53Ck2utP6HyPfEuFc9yN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01R1gLjghfkLkHD7GZaZL4jZ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GND3zjpNoHYZ9uoQJ5yVLn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AGG9wE9FxUB5LSPuZ5YZvm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a known version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NZ25S3QXZmkXqqgb3vb5HN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Dkab4Vi864pGyjdqe5R7xx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FdwdSXWpMuXFNA4j1QuYsY", "caller": 