*Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been created, so I didn't send it again and only one on-call page went out. It's open as INC-0001 and records the failure, both rollback attempts and the current state.\n- **Follow-ups (listed in the incident):** find out why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy), and look into why the first rollback stopped partway.", "type": "text"}]}]}